1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:01,336
Try the Vulcan salute:

2
00:00:01,336 --> 00:00:02,650
split your fingers,

3
00:00:02,650 --> 00:00:03,180
two

4
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:04,520
and TWO.

5
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:05,490
Can't?

6
00:00:05,490 --> 00:00:07,032
Your middle and ring fingers

7
00:00:07,032 --> 00:00:08,839
are holding hands...

8
00:00:08,839 --> 00:00:10,433
under your skin.

9
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:12,037
Their cords are tied together

10
00:00:12,037 --> 00:00:13,333
by a little strap.

11
00:00:13,358 --> 00:00:15,011
And your brain usually moves them

12
00:00:15,011 --> 00:00:16,333
as a team.

13
00:00:16,363 --> 00:00:17,520
In lab tests,

14
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:19,974
they're the worst at moving alone.

15
00:00:19,974 --> 00:00:21,230
The ring finger?

16
00:00:21,230 --> 00:00:22,500
Dead last.

17
00:00:22,550 --> 00:00:24,461
Even Star Trek actors reportedly

18
00:00:24,461 --> 00:00:26,680
set their fingers with the other hand...

19
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:28,050
off camera.

20
00:00:28,290 --> 00:00:29,610
Using your other hand now,

21
00:00:29,610 --> 00:00:30,878
aren't you?

